        {
          "script": [
                {
                    "speakerID": 1,
                    "line": "Hey, Rock-Star."
                },
                {
                    "speakerID": 5,
                    "line": "Uh... What-"
                },
                {
                    "speakerID": 1,
                    "line": "Yeah, I realised I prefer flying solo. And I want that record deal."
                },
                {
                    "speakerID": 1,
                    "line": "So, surrender or meet your doom. Or whatever they say."
                },
                {
                    "speakerID": 5,
                    "line": "What's going on, Ghoul? I thought we were in this together?"
                },
                {
                    "speakerID": 1,
                    "line": "Look, if you wanna hear it so bad: You're the best guitarist I've ever had."
                },
                {
                    "speakerID": 1,
                    "line": "But I'm so sick of being your little bassist."
                },
                {
                    "speakerID": 1,
                    "line": "I've got something to prove and YOU are the last person I want in my way."
                },
                {
                    "speakerID": 4,
                    "line": "W-wait, hold o-."
                }
          ],
