        {
          "script": [
                    {
                        "line": "Ghoul... It's over. We don't need to fight anymore. Just... come back. We made music that mattered, remember?",
                        "speakerID": 3
                    },
                    {
                        "line": "You really think a few chords fix everything? You took the spotlight, Rock. You always did.",
                        "speakerID": 7
                    },
                    {
                        "line": "I never wanted to take it from you. I just wanted us to shine together.",
                        "speakerID": 3
                    },
                    {
                        "line": "And... and maybe we still can.",
                        "speakerID": 3
                    },
                    {
                        "line": "What?",
                        "speakerID": 7
                    },
                    {
                        "line": "If you just... tell me right now that the past 3 years weren't for nothing and that you still care about me...",
                        "speakerID": 3
                    },
                    {
                        "line": "You'll forgive me?",
                        "speakerID": 7
                    },
                    {
                        "line": "No!",
                        "speakerID": 3
                    },
                    {
                        "line": "Not now.",
                        "speakerID": 3
                    },
                    {
                        "line": "But I wouldn't mind jamming together some time.",
                        "speakerID": 0
                    },
                    {
                        "line": "Rock...",
                        "speakerID": 7
                    },
                    {
                        "line": "I'm sorry.",
                        "speakerID": 1
                    },
                                        {
                        "line": "Let's make a new playlist.",
                        "speakerID": 1
                    }           
          ],
